{"parse": {"title": "SC-10", "pageid": 93633, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/SC-09\" title=\"SC-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SC-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/SC-11\" title=\"SC-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.8A.BD.E4.B8.9D.E5.89.A5.E8.8C.A7.E8.AE.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"抽丝剥茧论\">抽丝剥茧论</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 抽丝剥茧论</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Unraveling the Mystery</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>拨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>迷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>拨<span class=\"color-value\"></span>开<span class=\"color-value\"></span>茧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>丝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>告<span class=\"color-value\"></span>诉<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>真<span class=\"color-value\"></span>相<span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2510110</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_lvguan\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>请让我重新整理一下吧，两位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>空脑袋小姐，你提到你能够使用拉普拉斯科算中心开发的特制胶片，以“拍摄”的方法记录你的记忆并备份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>所以虽然你本人并不记得自己是否曾经将神秘学藏品管理部的危险神秘学管理品流出到外界，但按理来说，你的记忆胶片中应当记录了一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>——然而，那些胶片却不见了。<br />是这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>是呀……通常我会把重要的“记忆”随身携带，将其他记忆放在自己的房间里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>基金会发现失窃当天出入管理部的只有我后，派人前往我的房间进行了搜查。可他们却没有发现能够证明我清白的、失窃当天的胶片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>再加上说是有什么其他的证据……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空脑袋的声音低了下去，在场的另一个人义愤填膺地补完了她未说完的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>——所以他们就断定空脑袋是犯人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>但在我看来这根本不可能，一定是哪里出了错！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这名自称为追捕莱瑟姆而来的基金会职员，在十分钟前接到了梁月的一通电话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当她进入梁月称“找到了线索”的房间，见到空脑袋时脱口而出“你怎还没走”后……空脑袋的另一部分证言也得到了印证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-311013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月的叹息声，让端坐在床上的两名少女默契地低下了头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>所以在找到莱瑟姆小姐后，你并没有对她实施抓捕，而是为莱瑟姆小姐安排了逃亡的车票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>我知道这不合规矩，但空脑袋不可能是犯人，一定是哪里搞错了。<br />作为朋友，我不能就这样将她绑回基金会，坐视她被草草定罪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>刚才我向你隐瞒了这一切……我感到非常抱歉。<br />但因为你是夜巡特遣管理局的人，所以我想我必须不能露出破绽……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>如果可以的话，梁小姐，波蒂埃小姐，我希望你们能够替我与空脑袋保密。<br />等我们查出犯人究竟是谁，再向上面汇报也不迟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>可以吗？求求你们了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>斯考特的眼神中透出恳求，而一旁的空脑袋也同样用晶莹剔透的摄像头期待地盯着梁月与波蒂埃二人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两名少女可怜兮兮的模样让人心生怜悯，甚至让梁月产生了一种自己似乎正在虐待某种无害小动物的错觉……但这场非正式的审讯还没有结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>这件事等我们把事情弄清楚后再讨论也不迟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>刚才说到这个眼镜妹给了你去其他城市的车票，但你为什么还在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空脑袋尴尬地笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>谁能想到呢？在我乘坐出租车去车站的路上，对面的司机好像突然发了疯，直接越过实线和我们撞在了一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>幸亏撞到的是我坐的副驾驶席这侧。<br />我的身体结实，但那个司机可是肉体凡胎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一旁的梁月略作思索，挖掘出储备在记忆中的某条信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>昨天上午的交通事故……我看过记录，那名肇事司机身上也出现了原因不明的精神异常，说不定他也是事件的受害人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>在那之后呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>我被送到了医院，然后就遇到了你嘛。<br />那个时候我还以为你就是来抓我的人，所以连忙跑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>斯考特说带着手机和便携联络装置会被定位，所以我早早就把它们丢掉了，可这下我也联系不上她，不知道该如何是好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>而且……说实话，虽然没有记忆，但我总觉得自己并没有干那些坏事。<br />就这样离开总觉得怪怪的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>所以我就又回到了唐人街，去找菲林士多导演帮忙了。<br />毕竟她在这里拍电影，就算没有手机，我也能找到她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空脑袋提到的那个名字十分关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>……你提到你和菲林士多相识，能讲讲当时的经过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>当然啦！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_jiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_jiedao\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_jiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-2_5_bg_jiedao.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_jiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-2_5_bg_jiedao.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_jiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/54/Cg-2_5_bg_jiedao.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_jiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>让我看看，星光大道……星光大道……<br />有了！在这里，它在左边！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>……但左边是哪里？当我转身，我的左边就会变一个方向……不是吗？<br />大家都是怎么使用地图的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>发生什么了？你看起来需要帮助。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_lvguan\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>——是菲林士多女士帮助了迷路的我，她说她对我的脑袋很感兴趣。<br />而聊了几句后，我发现她居然是一名导演！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>在送我去星光大道的路上，我们聊了很多关于电影的话题。在听说我是一个人来旅游、没有什么特别的安排后，她就邀请我一起来唐人街这边拍电影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>这我怎么能拒绝呢？<br />这可是大导演亲自指导拍摄的片场，我绝对不会错过的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>但菲林士多女士带领你和剧组成员来到唐人街的那一天，正好是唐人街一带开始出现异常神秘学事件的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那颗激动得晃来晃去的脑袋迟疑地停住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>这……这我就不知道了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>那一天有发生什么奇怪的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摄像头闪了闪。“空脑袋”的脑袋里似乎浮现出了什么东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>说起来，那天晚上在来到唐人街后，我住进这个房间收拾行李，发现了一张奇怪的胶片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>奇怪的……胶片？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>等等，难道说那个就是……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>胶片二字让在场的另外三人都提起了注意力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但不知道是否因为摄像头的视野范围不够宽，瞬间成为视线焦点的那名意识唤醒者少女并没有察觉到众人紧张的凝视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只见她放下自己沉甸甸的背包，一边在口中念叨着，一边悠哉游哉地翻找起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>是呀，我会给记忆胶片们贴上标记，“每天都要看的”“要经常看看的”……经常复习，才不会忘记重要的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>在住进这间房间后，我也打算来一次“定期复习”，却发现我的胶片里有一张没有贴任何标记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311215.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311215.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/HeadIconSmall-311215.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311215.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>仔细一看，那盘胶片的材质也不对，它不是我的记忆胶片。<br />我觉得很奇怪，就用自己放映了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>胶片中的内容是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>那好像是一部电影，但是很短，像是片花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311216.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311216.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311216.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311216.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311216.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311216.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/HeadIconSmall-311216.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311216.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>奇怪的是里面的内容根本不知所云，有很多莫名其妙的画面和声音，我猜可能是谁的恶作剧……奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停下了手上翻动背包的动作，茫然地抬起头来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>怎么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-311213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>那盘胶片……不见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>——你说什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>诧异令波蒂埃抬高了嗓门，空脑袋被吓了一跳，心虚地缩了缩身子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/HeadIconSmall-311201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>反正我没有找到……之前我就是放在包里的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>给我，我来找！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>波蒂埃抓过空脑袋的那只鼓鼓囊囊的背包，将里面的东西一口气都倾倒在了床上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"630413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-630413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-630413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"630413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-630413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-630413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-630413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-630413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"130\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>你的包怎么比我妹妹的还乱？你都不整理的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如龙卷风般，波蒂埃在空脑袋诸如“我只是忘记扔了”“那个还有用”的尖叫声中，将她的背包连同整个房间都搜刮了一个遍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，她不得不得出那个令人绝望的结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>——没有！哪里都没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">波蒂埃：</div><div>你这个空脑袋，不会是不小心把它带出门弄丢了，或者和交给披萨外卖员的小费弄混了之类的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>就算是我也不会把胶片和钱弄混啦！<br />我这几天的记忆胶片可以证明，我没有把它弄丢，它就是这样自己消失了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>记忆胶片只能记录到你所见到的场景，也许是有人在你的摄像头所照不到的地方拿走了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>还有任何人知道这张胶片的事吗？在你播放那盘胶片后，有谁曾经造访，或是发现过什么可疑的事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>可疑的迹象？我想应该没有……至少我没有发现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>在我播放完那盘胶片之后，除了斯考特来通知我被基金会当作犯人的消息之外，也没有什么可疑的人来过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>哦！不过在放映的时候，菲林士多导演也和我在一起。<br />因为她说对我的记忆胶片很感兴趣，所以就来了我的房间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另外三个人见了鬼一样的目光，让空脑袋怯生生地咽下了剩下的话语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>……怎么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯考特：</div><div>所以……是那个菲林士多导演偷偷拿走了胶片？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_pianchang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_pianchang\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_pianchang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-2_5_bg_pianchang.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_pianchang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-2_5_bg_pianchang.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_pianchang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-2_5_bg_pianchang.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_pianchang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-519001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-519001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-519001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">演员：</div><div>你做什么——呃啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一记重拳，男子被狠狠打飞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——本该是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-519001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-519001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fa/HeadIconSmall-519001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">演员：</div><div>对不起导演，我再来一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>你没有武术的功底，倒地的时候容易磕到头部，叫你做那个动作还是太危险了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>去休息吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一身狼狈的演员本还想继续争取，但所有人都知道这名看似温和的导演一旦做出决定，就不会轻易改变主意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他张了张嘴，最终还是满脸歉意地依言走到了一旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理：</div><div>这就是最后一个人了，导演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理：</div><div>这里不像香港，没有那么多现成的龙虎武师可供我们选择。<br />刘老师和他的弟子们再过几天就会到了，要不这场戏稍微等一下？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>凯斯那边没有档期。<br />让我想想，还有什么其他的方法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>短短一句话，自然道不尽这位香港名导远渡重洋后面临的诸多难题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她放松身体，让后背靠在轮椅的椅背上，用微微垂下的双眸不着痕迹地扫过整个片场，寻找破局的一子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……嗯？是她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿琳顺着菲林士多的目光看去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">助理：</div><div>那是……白天的那名小女警？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/HeadIconSmall-615801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">龙套演员：</div><div>你又来做什么？听着，我不知道你们警察找菲林士多导演究竟是为了什么，但可以不要再打扰我们拍摄了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">工作人员：</div><div>我们这里并不允许外人参观，如果您没有搜查令的话就请回吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">空脑袋：</div><div>大家不要这么凶嘛！<br />梁并不是坏人，只是偶尔看起来有些可怕而已……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，某位见习执夜人少女的到来并不受欢迎，连带着走在她身旁的摄像头脑袋也遭到了一些质疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但梁月没有理会旁人。在进入片场环顾一周后，她便已经锁定了她的目标，径直向那个方向走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梁月在目标人物的面前站定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>没想到我们这么快就又见面了，警官小姐。<br />您是还有什么其他的疑惑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>我想我白天应当已经说得很清楚了，我对您目前正在调查的案件一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>您误会了，菲林士多导演。这次我是来帮忙的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……帮忙？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>我听莱瑟姆小姐说，您正在为缺少身手出众的龙套演员而发愁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梁月：</div><div>如果您不介意，我想也许我能够帮上您的忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>菲林士多错愕地眨了眨眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">菲林士多：</div><div>……这我倒是没有想到。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SC-10"}}